  "vibe": "Three days, no sleep. Night #191227 under two swinging beam polygons — violet #8f5cff and hot pink #ff4f9a at 22% — with fourteen confetti chips in lime #c8f04f and pink tumbling at 120°/s, a solid ink crowd wave along the bottom edge and seven raised-arm strokes swaying above it. Bungee sets everything uppercase and blocky over Rubik; cards carry a pink glow and tiles sit tilted ±2.5°. Its own beats are crowd control: Notify:pop fires pill toasts at staggered offsets, Swipe:swipe flings the top card right at 18° with a stamp, Toggle:dial sweeps a 2×2 wall of rotary knobs. Titles bounce in with overshoot; the camera hops and spins. Best for festivals, club nights, sports drops, ticketing and youth brands.",
